{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "5eb97a9cbefb3ae7cde769e90e776eae596547c1f05ebdc17a927029bdf63fdf", "ja": "にゃ、うにゃにゃにゃ、にゃ～お？\nなーご……にゃお～んっ！", "zh": "喵、呜喵喵喵、喵～呜？\n喵呜……喵嗷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1001_p", "source_sha256": "71f331fadb732ace17eef592238f16b55bc0e5b3500a17fa5ff54f5f5862ee50", "ja": "た、貴音！？\nいきなりネコの真似なんてして、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "贵、贵音！？  \n突然学起猫叫来，这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "e98c27e9a128695a2a99f0b4a1689f68ae82242135a0e5833a1862d746689484", "ja": "……失礼いたしました。\n仔細の説明が必要でしたね。私としたことが。", "zh": "……失礼了。\n确实应该先说明原委呢。我真是太不谨慎了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "f54e574c945d085c15df9231612c3c2722940b231c93e2d6df8710e166af2df6", "ja": "あなた様は覚えていらっしゃいますでしょうか？\n先日、廃校舎で行われた肝試しいべんとを。", "zh": "您是否还记得呢？\n前些天在废弃校舍举办的试胆活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ffdecacbfa03ba1ab67f516d8f61c29a9e638d6165268c90c967ce9a3f9594e3", "ja": "もちろん。校舎内を歩いて屋上に行くと、\n貴音が化け猫の姿で待ってたな。", "zh": "当然记得。穿过校舍走到屋顶后，\n贵音扮成化猫的样子在那等着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "3fa8c879cd899e7188d030a649ebf2880f52a666cb657029957cf4923ae7c3db", "ja": "ええ。最後の脅かし役という役目をいただきましたが\n慣れぬ衣装と怖さで、ふがいない結果に……。", "zh": "是的。虽然承蒙安排担任最后的吓人角色，却因为不习惯的服装和恐怖感，结果实在不尽如人意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1006_p", "source_sha256": "bcfb66d90d80007d86e4fec9e83a3e975652eb7aabd7abbe0bf6f9644572b43f", "ja": "そんなことはないと思うけど。\n一生懸命頑張る姿は、すごく可愛かったぞ。", "zh": "我倒不觉得是这样。\n你努力加油的样子，特别可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "5650d6895ae0c06accf886f70d9ecd10b31ae2fbdd5fd0a8c94797786d923d52", "ja": "ありがとうございます。しかし、肝試しと言うからには\nもっと恐怖を与えるべきだったと反省しています。", "zh": "谢谢您。不过，既然是试胆，\n我就应该制造更多恐怖才对，对此我也在反省。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "2cde8c0522ff0ecb0012a2a610855dbdda00cc880d452b0a96573da724f2c2c4", "ja": "いべんとは終わりましたが……いつ化け猫を\n演じてもいいように、私なりに修練をしていたのです。", "zh": "虽然活动已经结束了……但为了无论何时要扮演化猫都能演好，我便按自己的方式进行了修炼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9f531d3ae28d0cdcb8a42062a35d51ede1fc2ab94c90b1de1c5db41a5813170e", "ja": "化け猫の修練……あっ。\nそれでネコの真似をしてたのか！", "zh": "妖怪猫的修炼……啊。\n所以你之前才一直在学猫叫啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "bb6e8657e803de15c6dcdb1cfa4c1e719fedd0fe88bf3ea0b0b898ebc8c957c6", "ja": "にゃにゃっ、にゃお～っ！　ふしゃーっ！\n……その、どうでしょう？　恐ろしいでしょうか？", "zh": "喵喵、喵呜——！哈——！\n……那个，你觉得怎么样？很可怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1011_p", "source_sha256": "32f73ff7971c976d78d59803c17fe4e4f1d25b0385d935c9b1d2a75175b69931", "ja": "……ええと、そうだな。\n貴音ならではの魅力にあふれた化け猫だと思う！", "zh": "……呃，这个嘛。\n我觉得这是只充满了贵音独有魅力的化猫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "403ccdfa9268cafe27b564feb0d4340b387ca951580da85f20294785608f84a0", "ja": "そう、ですか……。やはり、恐ろしい化け猫は\n私には向いていないのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "是这样吗……果然，恐怖的妖猫或许不适合我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4360029f32952e810d1425bfd1e21ffea8ed321e235912420d5cf02957590d8b", "ja": "あ、いや……。", "zh": "啊，不是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "fd98bbda5eaafd1a6fd9e4110b167f851f846fdd63c3109444280032b2d63f07", "ja": "お気遣い、ありがとうございます。ですが、\nこの一度きりの機会で諦めたわけではありません。", "zh": "谢谢您的关心。不过，我并没有因为这次唯一的机会就放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0423_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "c1038a199533b02c79a71cb9a3e0b8b728887db0c0661df09ea5ea7d58e14fd6", "ja": "次回、この大役を射止めた時は……完璧な化け猫として\n皆に恐怖を与えてみせましょう！　にゃ～お！", "zh": "下次再争取到这个重要角色时……我一定要以完美的妖猫形象，给大家带来恐惧！喵——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
